category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
levels 60-60
zone Azshara
keywords Fragmented Magic, Archmage Xylem, Sanath Lim-yo, Warlord Krellian, Prismatic Shell, Ruins of Eldarath, Temple of Zin-Malor, Spitelash, Polymorph Clone, Polymorph, pig, Mage, class spell
